  <p>If the prim lacks a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlLinkSitTarget" target="_blank">sit target</a> or there is no avatar sitting on the prim, then <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/NULL_KEY" target="_blank">NULL_KEY</a> is returned.</p>
